# This directory stores pre-processed EEG data caches
#
# Local setup: cache/tusz_mmap/ → Memory-mapped NPY files
# - train/: 4667 NPY files (data + labels) + manifest.json
# - dev/: 1832 NPY files (data + labels) + manifest.json
#
# ⚠️ CRITICAL WSL2 WARNING:
# Memory-mapped files MUST be on native Linux filesystem (ext4/btrfs)!
# DO NOT use Windows drives (/mnt/c/, /mnt/d/) - WSL2's 9P filesystem
# causes mmap page evictions → SIGBUS crashes during training
#
# See SIGBUS_CRASH_ANALYSIS.md for full technical details
#
# The actual data files are excluded by .gitignore
# This .gitkeep ensures the directory structure is documented in git
